{"id":"W259370337c768c5363946107","zh":"拉丁超立方抽样","en":"","name":"拉丁超立方抽样","language":"zh","domain":"文献术语","concept_id":null,"families":[],"definition_zh":null,"definition_en":null,"scope_note":null,"usage_note":null,"usage_overview":null,"translation_note":null,"usage_variants":[],"designations":[{"id":"W259370337c768c5363946107","text":"拉丁超立方抽样","language":"zh","role":"headword"}],"complete_examples":[{"id":"Sd49877130c32dd20aa9f","source_id":"P112","page":2,"page_end":2,"language":"zh","text":"若以月为监测的时间单位,假定第i月此线路区段轨道随机不平顺谱在累计上、下限概率分别为Ci,u和 Ci,d的累计概率谱内波动;同时,用τi→k,u、 τi→k,d表示从第i月到第k月的上、下限谱累计概率变化率,一般存在等式 Ck,u|d=Ci,u|d(1±τi→k,u|d) (1) (3)根据(2)中确定的线路不平顺谱线累计概率范围,采用拉丁超立方抽样(LHS)方法 [6]进行此累计概率范围内轨道谱的抽样,对采集的轨道谱进行逆傅里叶变换 [3],生成随机轨道不平顺时域样本。","citations":[{"source_id":"P112","page":2,"page_end":2}]}],"sources":{"P003":{"id":"P003","title":"A probabilistic model for track random irregularities in vehicle/track coupled dynamics","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai, J Gao","year":"2017","doi":"10.1016/j.apm.2017.06.027","journal_citation":"Applied Mathematical Modelling 51, 145-158","label":"Xu等（2017）","overview_slug":"xu-2017-track-irregularity"},"P016":{"id":"P016","title":"Probabilistic assessment of railway vehicle-curved track systems considering track random irregularities","authors":"L Xu, W Zhai","year":"2018","doi":"10.1080/00423114.2018.1424916","journal_citation":"Vehicle System Dynamics 56 (10), 1552-1576","label":"Xu等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probabilistic-assessment-of-railway-vehicle-curved-track-systems-considering-track-random-irregulari"},"P112":{"id":"P112","title":"用于铁路线路基础结构伤损识别的概率密度分布演化方法","authors":"徐磊,翟婉明,陈宪麦,陶伟峰","year":"2018","doi":"10.3969/j.issn.1001-8360.2018.12.014","journal_citation":"铁道学报","label":"徐磊等（2018）","overview_slug":"2018-probability-density-distribution-evolution-method-for-damage-detection-of-railway-infrastructure"}},"relations":[],"related_terms":[],"collocations":[],"symbols":[],"units":[],"formulas":[],"external_references":[],"suggested_comp